# T_SCRE: the categories' code list: a category added (its code given
# once, as the positional word of CAT ADD), its name changed with Ctrl-E, a
# category that items have refused on Del, and the new one deleted after
# the question.
S CATS
K INS
S NEWCAT
T ZIP
K TAB
T Zip drives
K TAB
T 11
K CTRL-S
S ADDED
K END CTRL-E
S EDITCAT
K CTRL-Y
T Zip and Jaz drives
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K HOME DEL
T Y
S INUSE
K END DEL
S DELQ
T Y
S DELETED
K ESC
